Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish If you want it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,gotta go over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,no Cause I'm aiming to get there\Nfirst, yeah It's all or nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,no time to worry Do it later,\Nright now I'm living free
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you It
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.38,0:00:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not\Nan option Once they're closed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.68,0:01:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the satisfaction\NYou think I'm rude,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,here's my appreciation When\Nthings are getting tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,just gotta smile
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way\NAnd you're looking for a fresh,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,brand new day Then make sure your\Nonly thought you have is Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.92,0:01:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way Marks\Nmaps will be made Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,With every step that you will\Ntake, just look at all you've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.26,0:01:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,through Look ahead at new horizons\NIn view shining brightly Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,who knows what's waiting for you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way\NMake like a hurricane Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.50,0:01:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you've got to make your mark today
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,one wish Your dreams don't\Nrun away Go for the knockout
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Gloom Island,\Nlocated on the Grand Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.42,0:02:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Straw Hats were separated for\Ntwo years, Zoro trained himself here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In an old castle near a\Nlake in this fallen country,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,an enigmatic man passes his days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.56,0:02:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a member of the\NSeven Warlords of the Sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and said to be the strongest\Nswordsman in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Dracule Mihawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Moria? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.74,0:03:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.65,0:03:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,not dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.64,0:03:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gekko, Moria and his zombie\Narmy are on the prowl again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Moria's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,On the brawl, they said!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look, it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his big, dumb, wonderful face!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I read the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why didn't you tell me? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.76,0:03:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Moria's very important to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care. You should!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my captain, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought for sure he died\Nin Marineford two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.22,0:03:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mori is alive, maybe he\Ngot the gang back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.92,0:03:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's already with\NHogback and Absalom too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Horororo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I should thank him\Nfor letting me stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I wanted to come to this\Nkingdom exactly. Kuma sent me flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,here from Thriller Bark after that\Nfight with the Straw Hats but i've just
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,been hanging out for two years if\Nnothing else moria is persistent like
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.68,0:04:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A horde of zombies he employs. Say\Nwhat, you dare insult Moria? Ungrateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.59,0:04:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe him nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten all those\Ntimes that I cooked for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You cooked, yes, but I cooked more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I helped you\Nwith farming stuff, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And I gave you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,a place to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.48,0:04:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the least new thing in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.74,0:04:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving. As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not mad, I'm not mad
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.64,0:05:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be nice! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to storm off here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Fionn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You did so much for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Noisy to the end, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.44,0:05:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.35,0:05:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Considering the circumstances,\Nnow may be a good time to depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The reverie is in session\Nat Marie Joie, as you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:05:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They brought up a troubling subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There is Absalom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.96,0:06:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Break him to me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I shot them, but they just won't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me where Absalom is or else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You stupid underlings are useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, have it your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't want to deal with me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.26,0:07:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me where to find Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.06,0:07:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't listening to me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me Blackbeard or\Nyou're going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna drag you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Awful noisy, Meowth, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.28,0:08:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Pizarro, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Gekko Moria!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The former warlord of the sea! Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you let him in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke in, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,With his zombie army!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.02,0:08:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The port is completely destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what he's looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,seems he wants to see commodore\Nteach he's looking for his old
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.62,0:08:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Gourmet absalom that invisible guy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,who was here the other day oh i see
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.26,0:08:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you chumps really aren't working\Nwith me huh you think i won't
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,break in there and wreck you maria
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,over here i'm so happy you made it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.04,0:08:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Absalom, is that really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.60,0:08:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.54,0:08:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In the flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.24,0:08:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you might be\Ndead! Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:08:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never felt better!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard a thing about\Nyou since we all split up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You were making me nervous!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.30,0:09:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about that, boss, but\Nthis place is a party every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.56,0:09:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost track of time having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.18,0:09:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to reach out to you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's all it is, I'm\Njust happy to have you back
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.84,0:09:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I went a little overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, zombies that's enough\Nchaos go back to the ship I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Blackbeard\Nmight have nabbed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,His crew hunts down people with powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.00,0:09:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone got your clear clear\Nfruit, we'd be in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.52,0:09:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Invisibility is a useful power to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It can be very deadly in the right hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, I know that very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.70,0:10:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Who caught me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on and fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiryu, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You worked at Impel Down,\Nbut joined up with Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Close enough, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how do you like my new power?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You were invisible, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have Absalom's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, but it is, Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My thanks to your old Gourmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.76,0:11:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This will prove quite useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's not Absalom up\Nthere, who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Maroon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Devon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.06,0:12:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me, what did you do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.12,0:12:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Absalom waltzed into our home with a\Nchip on his shoulder, so we shoved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But his body is here, if you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.72,0:12:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You love a good corpse, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make every last one of you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He was my Gourmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He was my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You say I love corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all gonna be corpses\Nwhen I'm done with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.14,0:13:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, if you want to try, be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.86,0:13:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't have you disturbing\Nthe peace here on Pirate Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I'll see you there myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.28,0:13:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'll pass, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at my leisure now, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.08,0:13:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a pirate's paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.94,0:13:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That means it ought to be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've picked enough fights today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to party!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you'd like to party,\Nyou're welcome on my ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.54,0:14:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Moria, you like to party, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.02,0:14:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So did you happen to read the newspaper\Ntoday? There's never a dull moment lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,on the fourth day of reverie the\Ncaptains of the revolutionary army
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:15:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Made their move. They risked it all\Nto take back Kuma, busting into Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,juan facing off with two navy\Nadmirals rio kugyu and Fujitora must
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.78,0:15:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,have been a sight and that's not the\Nhalf of it there's also something
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,going down the land of wano where\Nthe monster kaido lives Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's been a lot of talk\Nlately. Is there along with a whole
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,slew of hot-blooded punks and hot\Non his tail is another emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.54,0:15:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,angry as a wet head crazy old big
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,mom what do you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.22,0:15:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,think will happen next
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning of\Nthe end, you tough guys. All
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.34,0:15:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,seem to want the throne but\Nthere can only be one king
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Guitar solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.28,0:17:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.76,0:17:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,want
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.56,0:18:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's as strong as Duke Dock, Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just as quick and\Njust as hard-headed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand, Asura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You Gar are wasting this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Use it to fight to protect the\Npeople of Wano that Lord Oden loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Oden is dead. Why did you\Ncome back after all these years?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.66,0:18:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When the country has gone to\Nhell We're here to accomplish
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.20,0:18:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Odin's dream. A dream that\NUgar abandoned. And now Ugar are
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.96,0:19:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Selfishly wielding your sword as\Nyour people suffer. Shut up, him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.18,0:19:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You speak as if you're so\Nwise, but you aren't even here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something\Nyou've got to want to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.48,0:19:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.02,0:19:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck fire style, fire willow blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.40,0:19:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.14,0:19:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogstorm!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ashura!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:19:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were better\Nthan this. I'm disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.46,0:20:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You too? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.26,0:20:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have watched the land of Wano for the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,past two decades since\NLord Odin's sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You all show up like no time has passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.30,0:20:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no obligation to listen. Now leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.52,0:20:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,since I'm such a scoundrel, you should be\Ngrateful I don't rob you on your way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.46,0:20:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you all forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is who we were before\NLord Odin changed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden was a man among men,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.70,0:20:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,one who I would proudly risk\Nmy life for as a samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.14,0:20:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the only one I served.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.94,0:20:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not bow to the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe this country nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.06,0:20:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.26,0:21:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a scoundrel, as you say, myself,\Nbut I have not abandoned my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.50,0:21:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You will join Ashida.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Of that I will make certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.36,0:21:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You honestly think this country\Nwill welcome the Kozuki clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe your foolish arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You abandoned our home for 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.86,0:21:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't compensate for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All that we've lost won't return.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yutia aren't injured, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.14,0:21:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.10,0:21:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon the interruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.86,0:21:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Raizo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.12,0:21:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to ascertain\Nthe location of Sir Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.66,0:22:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's confined at the\Nexcavation labor camp in Udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.08,0:22:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.28,0:22:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you were the most\Nsuited to deal with this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.64,0:22:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Say no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.32,0:22:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama, please say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.10,0:22:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.28,0:22:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you suffered a\Nvicious attack from Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, these fine doctors found\Nyou and brought you here to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.90,0:22:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you all very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I am in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.78,0:22:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, you weren't hurt bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.80,0:22:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be better real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.46,0:22:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.94,0:22:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.00,0:22:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember I got scared\Nand passed out right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.82,0:22:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So I don't really know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:22:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Or why someone like Kaido\Nwould attack me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.76,0:22:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can remember is that Horselina\Nfought super hard to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.60,0:23:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Master, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.58,0:23:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So you, Gaara, have the power to\Nturn your enemies into allies?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.30,0:23:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be very handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.24,0:23:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happened to Horselina?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.16,0:23:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And where is Big Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.70,0:23:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we didn't see anyone\Nnamed Horselina, and Luffy was...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.04,0:23:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.95,0:23:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro got smashed by Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.62,0:23:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And now he's stuck at the camp in Udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.48,0:23:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.14,0:23:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you're still injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.12,0:23:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.04,0:23:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm way more worried about Big\NBro Luvi than some scratches.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.68,0:23:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.80,0:23:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our captain always pulls\Nthrough, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.60,0:23:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Udon is one of several\Nregions in the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.02,0:23:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.93,0:23:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,under the current regime,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.04,0:24:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,most of its inhabitants are criminals,\Ncondemned to the excavation labor camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.24,0:24:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido's lucrative weapons trade is\Nbolstered by the slave labor in these mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.84,0:24:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dreadful place where the prisoners\Nare forced to work until they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.12,0:24:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With no hope of escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.30,0:24:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we don't require geisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.06,0:24:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let anyone approach this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.08,0:24:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.92,0:25:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the order sheet for the\Nnext round of armor and weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.58,0:25:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As wicked as they come, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.54,0:25:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.64,0:25:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My, that's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.40,0:25:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone has a war on the horizon, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.20,0:25:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't concern myself\Nwith what happens abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.64,0:25:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.04,0:25:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Make what they want and\Ndon't ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.76,0:25:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My, how perfectly wicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.74,0:25:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.96,0:25:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes are too aged.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.66,0:25:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You must watch them in my stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.86,0:25:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.02,0:25:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Remain quiet above all else
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.34,0:25:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid heads in the way
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.02,0:26:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.08,0:26:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go up in the attic and get\Nthem stop them at any cost
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.60,0:26:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, just take some deep breaths!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.24,0:26:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.62,0:26:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stop screaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.80,0:26:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.24,0:26:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is it just a cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.46,0:26:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.04,0:26:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.02,0:26:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.92,0:27:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.92,0:27:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.92,0:27:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to freak out like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.46,0:27:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.02,0:27:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nami, there's something\Nthat I should have told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.20,0:27:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Find them!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.76,0:27:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep looking around!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.62,0:27:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the intruders escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.44,0:28:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.08,0:28:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a fear of sharp objects!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.10,0:28:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how are you a ninja?\NHave you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.78,0:28:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,hmm a mature woman is
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.88,0:28:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,as deadly as any weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.28,0:28:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,a fine wind let us catch it
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.10,0:28:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Minho!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.16,0:28:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Kite!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.60,0:28:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu, you can fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.16,0:29:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you found them, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.52,0:29:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you happen to acquire any intel?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.06,0:29:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.46,0:29:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.58,0:29:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But I saw the shipment's place and date.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.14,0:29:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.58,0:29:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take us straight to a\Nstockpile of weapons and armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.94,0:29:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Right for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.66,0:29:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, what's the hustle and bustle about?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.68,0:29:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one heck of a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.48,0:29:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be a sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.08,0:29:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like mostly young ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.40,0:29:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome one, welcome all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.58,0:29:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh soba coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.62,0:29:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, next one's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.20,0:29:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.26,0:30:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec. Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.02,0:30:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's firm, but tender.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.56,0:30:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet, savory, and oh-so-juicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.88,0:30:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the third son of five children.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.88,0:30:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My soba's too delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.46,0:30:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.40,0:30:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, five, two, eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.76,0:30:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And the sum is 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.52,0:30:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's today's\Nspecial. The noodles are
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.68,0:30:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,shining they really melt\Nin your mouth so good
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.60,0:30:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you're supposed to recruit\Nsamurai thank you ladies
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.26,0:30:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tale of terror. Ghastly apparitions\Nare about spreading a curse. Don't
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.08,0:31:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,miss our special edition covering the\Nghost sightings in the Northern Graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.94,0:31:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all the hubbub about?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.98,0:31:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to go look.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.50,0:31:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitokiri Kamazo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.86,0:31:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.08,0:31:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,His wicked grin is the\Nlast thing you'll ever see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.16,0:31:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He cuts down any poor fool in his path.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.28,0:31:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is he, and what does he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.12,0:31:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That bot took out my husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.18,0:31:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.38,0:31:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, perk up your ears for this one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.40,0:31:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you heard the tale of Ushimitsu Kozo?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.86,0:31:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He appears at the witching\Nhour to rob from the rich,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.36,0:31:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But this benevolent bandit shares his\Nill-gotten gains with those less fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.96,0:32:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Or so they say, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.78,0:32:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he an agent of justice\Nor just an agent of chaos?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.90,0:32:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could he be and\Nwhat's his next target?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.48,0:32:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be the last to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.08,0:32:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up a paper today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.50,0:32:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a big Ushinitsu fan. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.18,0:32:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,One for me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.40,0:32:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to miss this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.74,0:32:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it while it's hot\Nor get left in the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.44,0:32:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to ask me twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.64,0:32:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The reversed crescent moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.76,0:32:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gave me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.42,0:33:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.14,0:33:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Have they truly returned?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.44,0:33:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.56,0:33:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's just those ghosts\Nthat people keep seeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.04,0:33:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We've kept the faith for this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.00,0:33:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for action.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.90,0:34:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.78,0:34:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been too long. I fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.34,0:34:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years ago, I would\Nhave been itching to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.18,0:34:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond that, where are they\Ngoing to get their weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.02,0:34:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Only samurai can carry a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.80,0:34:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Citizens are all defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.04,0:34:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the training halls\Nhave been shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.54,0:34:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Karate, judo, and every last\Nweapon has been banned here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.64,0:34:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi has eliminated any\Nchance we'd have to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.34,0:34:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll beat them with my fists!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.38,0:34:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.52,0:34:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting so long to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.48,0:34:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.86,0:34:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.32,0:34:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My whole body is shaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.08,0:35:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy! Raizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.94,0:35:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.44,0:35:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.74,0:35:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, friend, it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.22,0:35:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I bring tidings from the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.94,0:35:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama has made a full recovery!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.74,0:35:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.94,0:35:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall return. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.10,0:35:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Jack, these offerings from\NCootie aren't gonna cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.66,0:36:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo isn't around anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.06,0:36:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You know who our next business\Npartner's gonna be, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.82,0:36:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.14,0:36:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need more dead\Nweight around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.08,0:36:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We already have Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.90,0:36:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.90,0:36:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And we don't need any more\NSexy when we already have King.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.54,0:36:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack the Stooge, you are on thin ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.16,0:36:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't act so tough\Nif I were you, Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.34,0:36:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have those punks\Nbegging for mercy by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.56,0:36:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.80,0:36:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna be runnin' that prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.90,0:36:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't accept\Ncriticism from perverts.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.86,0:36:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
